      "semantics": "CONTRACT-055. Pages, datasets, visuals, text blocks and filters are declarations independent of any BI platform. Dataset queries, field expressions and custom aggregations are retained with their language/version and are not parsed, executed or translated. Layout is an abstract grid; rendering, interactivity beyond declared filter targets, permissions and refresh are not described. Unknown fields remain incomplete interpretation. No native Lakeview or Tableau serialization is claimed.",
